WEBVTT

00:30.939 --> 00:34.489
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

00:34.509 --> 00:37.889
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

00:38.159 --> 00:44.129
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

00:45.289 --> 00:48.919
♪ East wind unfair ♪

00:48.939 --> 00:52.449
♪ Happy times rare ♪

00:52.469 --> 00:55.959
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

00:55.979 --> 00:59.489
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

00:59.509 --> 01:05.569
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

01:18.829 --> 01:23.109
Si Jin

01:23.129 --> 01:27.579
Episode 4

01:27.599 --> 01:29.909
(West Market)
Candied hawthorn!

01:29.929 --> 01:31.649
Would you like one?

01:32.679 --> 01:34.909
Young Master, you don't want it?

01:34.929 --> 01:36.019
What a joke.

01:36.039 --> 01:38.399
What man eats candied hawthorn?

01:42.679 --> 01:44.039
Thank you.

01:47.589 --> 01:49.629
(Qiaoxiang Shop)
It's closed.

01:49.649 --> 01:51.599
Shall we change to another one?

01:51.739 --> 01:53.939
No need, Qiaoniang
left the door open for me.

01:53.959 --> 01:54.889
You go in first.

01:54.889 --> 01:55.989
I'll wait outside.

01:56.009 --> 01:57.369
Okay, Zhan.

02:02.519 --> 02:03.359
Candied hawthorn.

02:03.369 --> 02:04.149
Candied hawthorn.

02:04.149 --> 02:05.569
- Young Master.
- Candied hawthorn.

02:05.569 --> 02:06.929
Young Master.

02:11.129 --> 02:12.459
Young Master.

02:12.479 --> 02:13.709
Didn't you say

02:13.729 --> 02:15.719
men don't eat candied hawthorn?

02:15.889 --> 02:16.969
In front of my sister,

02:16.969 --> 02:17.809
I am a man.

02:17.809 --> 02:19.869
In front of you, I'm your master.

02:19.889 --> 02:20.729
I'll eat.

02:20.749 --> 02:26.829
(Miss Jiang Si, always available)

03:17.889 --> 03:19.249
So sweet.

03:21.569 --> 03:22.929
Young Master.

03:27.359 --> 03:29.429
Aren't you Jiang Zhan?

03:29.449 --> 03:30.329
Last time, you left

03:30.329 --> 03:32.229
after offending
Marquis Changxing's heir.

03:32.249 --> 03:33.459
- This time,
- Flowers!

03:33.479 --> 03:34.719
it won't be so easy.

03:34.739 --> 03:35.499
Take a look!

03:35.499 --> 03:37.459
Marquis Changxing's heir
is my brother-in-law.

03:37.479 --> 03:38.929
What's it to you?

03:45.129 --> 03:47.489
I just don't like the look of you.

03:56.409 --> 03:57.809
What do you want?

04:02.409 --> 04:03.769
If you want to fight,

04:04.079 --> 04:05.569
I can do that.

04:05.689 --> 04:07.939
But there are so many people here.

04:07.959 --> 04:09.469
If we really fight,

04:09.489 --> 04:11.689
it won't be long
before the officers come.

04:11.719 --> 04:13.529
You won't get to have fun, right?

04:14.009 --> 04:15.469
Let's change the place.

04:21.689 --> 04:23.049
Good.

04:26.049 --> 04:27.869
Young Master, your wound...

04:27.889 --> 04:30.209
Tell my sister I have to go now.

04:36.159 --> 04:37.649
Your father's here.

04:40.689 --> 04:42.049
Chase him!

04:48.079 --> 04:49.789
- Is he there?
- No.

04:49.809 --> 04:51.649
- Is he here?
- No.

04:56.279 --> 04:57.639
I'm here.

05:01.159 --> 05:02.769
Jiang Zhan!

05:12.319 --> 05:13.769
Young Master Zhan.

05:15.079 --> 05:16.609
- The fruit looks fresh.
- Try some.

05:16.609 --> 05:18.259
- Are they just picked?
- Yes.

05:18.279 --> 05:19.639
I'll try one.

05:20.299 --> 05:21.489
Put it on my family's account.

05:21.489 --> 05:23.279
Thank you, Young Master Zhan.

05:23.839 --> 05:25.209
So sweet.

05:25.319 --> 05:26.869
Thanks for the compliment.

05:28.809 --> 05:32.649
How straight
the lonely smoke of the desert is.

05:32.929 --> 05:36.529
How round the setting sun
over the river is.

05:37.079 --> 05:39.719
Isn't this the setting sun of Ling'an?

05:42.719 --> 05:45.229
Ling'an is really prosperous.

05:45.249 --> 05:48.009
But the setting sun is not good enough.

05:48.199 --> 05:49.559
Wait.

05:50.279 --> 05:52.029
Where are you from?

05:52.049 --> 05:54.329
How can you look down
on our setting sun?

05:55.279 --> 05:56.939
What a narrow-minded frog.

05:56.959 --> 05:58.719
I'm narrow-minded?

05:59.929 --> 06:02.329
Tell me. Where is the best setting sun?

06:07.029 --> 06:12.389
(Lu Chuchu, Yu Qi's junior)

06:15.199 --> 06:17.039
Of course, it's outside the pass.

06:17.679 --> 06:19.619
How straight
the lonely smoke of the desert is.

06:19.629 --> 06:21.609
How round the setting sun
over the river is.

06:21.629 --> 06:22.989
Have you heard of it?

06:23.159 --> 06:25.989
It's about the scenery outside the pass.

06:26.719 --> 06:28.499
Sound like you've been outside the pass.

06:28.519 --> 06:30.039
Of course.

06:30.319 --> 06:32.479
I'm traveling the world

06:32.519 --> 06:33.789
to see

06:33.809 --> 06:35.919
all the world's beautiful views.

06:37.319 --> 06:38.959
I don't want to talk to you.

06:39.129 --> 06:40.619
I don't want to talk to you either.

06:40.639 --> 06:42.649
- Trinkets.
- Hey.

06:42.719 --> 06:44.279
Miss, what would you like?

06:44.609 --> 06:45.889
- This one.
- Eight wen each.

06:45.889 --> 06:47.249
Sure.

06:58.449 --> 06:59.569
You jerk.

06:59.569 --> 07:00.589
You talked to me

07:00.589 --> 07:02.149
so your accomplice could steal my money.

07:02.159 --> 07:03.519
What?

07:04.129 --> 07:05.489
What money?

07:05.609 --> 07:06.809
Stop pretending.

07:06.809 --> 07:07.789
Hurry and give it back.

07:07.809 --> 07:09.399
Little girl,

07:09.689 --> 07:11.089
you're so unreasonable.

07:11.089 --> 07:12.239
You're not smart either.

07:12.259 --> 07:13.319
What are you saying?

07:13.319 --> 07:14.409
I'm saying you're not smart.

07:14.409 --> 07:15.609
Your beauty is such a waste.

07:15.609 --> 07:16.719
- You...
- What?

07:16.719 --> 07:18.649
Come down if you dare.

07:20.809 --> 07:22.169
What are you doing?

07:23.569 --> 07:25.569
- Give me my money back.
- Pull me up.

07:25.569 --> 07:26.629
Women shouldn't touch men.

07:26.629 --> 07:28.249
Give me my money back.

07:28.759 --> 07:30.569
Do I look like someone

07:30.569 --> 07:32.059
who would steal your money?

07:32.079 --> 07:33.619
You have a frivolous and rogue look.

07:33.619 --> 07:34.809
You must've ruined your family

07:34.809 --> 07:36.719
so you do this shady business now.

07:37.449 --> 07:38.809
What are you doing?

07:39.959 --> 07:41.129
Help!

07:41.129 --> 07:42.169
She's harassing me!

07:42.169 --> 07:43.009
Shut up.

07:43.029 --> 07:44.399
Stop framing me.

07:44.449 --> 07:45.809
She's robbing me!

07:45.809 --> 07:47.329
Hurry! Help!

07:47.559 --> 07:49.049
I don't have time to waste with you.

07:49.049 --> 07:50.089
Since you don't admit it,

07:50.089 --> 07:51.339
I'll take this as compensation.

07:51.359 --> 07:52.669
I... I...

08:41.639 --> 08:42.649
Aren't the locals here

08:42.649 --> 08:43.789
supposed to be good swimmers?

08:43.799 --> 08:44.969
Hey, you frog.

08:44.969 --> 08:46.609
How come you can't even swim?

08:49.209 --> 08:50.799
Everyone, leave.

08:51.159 --> 08:52.439
Shopkeeper,

08:52.459 --> 08:53.559
bring me a cup of hot tea.

08:53.559 --> 08:54.919
Alright.

09:00.009 --> 09:01.799
- Thank you.
- No problem.

09:27.969 --> 09:29.329
Is he dead?

09:30.919 --> 09:31.829
Wake up.

09:31.849 --> 09:33.209
Wake up.

09:33.669 --> 09:34.979
- Wake up.
- Young Master Zhan!

09:34.989 --> 09:36.319
- Wake up.
- Young Master Zhan!

09:36.329 --> 09:38.019
Ji, hurry. Young Master Zhan...

09:38.039 --> 09:39.489
Wake up.

09:39.969 --> 09:41.329
Zhan!

09:41.609 --> 09:43.249
Si, I'm here!

09:50.919 --> 09:52.279
Zhan!

09:52.369 --> 09:54.679
- Zhan, are you okay?
- I'm fine.

09:54.679 --> 09:55.769
Zhan, didn't you promise me

09:55.769 --> 09:57.349
you wouldn't come to the riverbank?

09:57.369 --> 09:58.289
Didn't I tell you?

09:58.289 --> 09:59.829
You can't come to any riverbank.

09:59.849 --> 10:00.729
I forgot.

10:00.729 --> 10:01.609
How could you forget?

10:01.609 --> 10:02.309
You promised me.

10:02.309 --> 10:04.309
You can't swim.
You can't come to the riverbank.

10:04.309 --> 10:05.209
Si, don't worry.

10:05.209 --> 10:06.399
I promise you.

10:06.399 --> 10:07.419
I swear to the heavens.

10:07.439 --> 10:08.799
It's not about swearing.

10:08.799 --> 10:10.329
I just want you to be safe.

10:10.329 --> 10:11.249
You can't swim,

10:11.249 --> 10:12.269
but you keep coming here.

10:12.269 --> 10:13.589
It makes me worry.

10:13.609 --> 10:14.869
I know I'm wrong.

10:14.889 --> 10:16.249
Look, I'm fine.

10:16.249 --> 10:17.109
Nothing's wrong. See?

10:17.119 --> 10:18.829
Are you fine
after falling into the river?

10:18.829 --> 10:20.069
I'm totally fine.

10:25.889 --> 10:27.559
Sorry about this, Miss.

10:27.919 --> 10:29.529
Miss, are you

10:30.129 --> 10:31.369
a friend of my brother's?

10:31.369 --> 10:32.499
What friend?

10:32.519 --> 10:34.039
She's a robber.

10:46.489 --> 10:47.949
What are you looking at?

10:48.129 --> 10:49.679
Isn't it because of you?

10:49.729 --> 10:50.869
Si,

10:50.889 --> 10:52.469
I just talked to her.

10:52.489 --> 10:53.849
She lost her money

10:53.849 --> 10:55.349
and accused me of being a thief.

10:55.369 --> 10:56.899
Then she took my money.

10:56.919 --> 10:58.029
This is outrageous.

10:58.049 --> 10:59.259
Since you didn't steal it,

10:59.279 --> 11:00.129
take your money back.

11:00.129 --> 11:01.419
It was mine in the first place.

11:01.439 --> 11:03.889
What? You want to walk away?

11:05.249 --> 11:06.229
Miss,

11:06.249 --> 11:08.799
take this money for now.

11:09.209 --> 11:11.129
Why, Si?

11:11.609 --> 11:13.009
Your money was stolen;

11:13.009 --> 11:14.499
my brother is partly responsible.

11:14.519 --> 11:15.409
This is

11:15.409 --> 11:16.969
a little gesture from us.

11:18.609 --> 11:19.869
No need.

11:19.889 --> 11:20.989
It's a misunderstanding.

11:21.009 --> 11:22.399
I'm not someone who takes advantage.

11:22.399 --> 11:23.239
I know

11:23.249 --> 11:24.129
you must be

11:24.129 --> 11:25.419
a reasonable person.

11:25.439 --> 11:26.279
How about this?

11:26.289 --> 11:28.349
This money is like a loan from me.

11:28.369 --> 11:29.609
You must be new

11:29.609 --> 11:31.089
to Ling'an

11:31.089 --> 11:32.049
and probably need money

11:32.049 --> 11:33.469
for many things.

11:33.489 --> 11:35.069
Take this money first.

11:35.089 --> 11:36.409
When you're in a better position,

11:36.409 --> 11:38.979
you can return it to me
at Earl Dongping's Mansion.

11:41.009 --> 11:42.419
You seem like a good person,

11:42.439 --> 11:44.439
much better than your brother.

11:45.329 --> 11:47.379
Thank you, Miss.

11:47.399 --> 11:48.419
You're welcome.

11:48.439 --> 11:49.499
Rest assured.

11:49.519 --> 11:51.469
I will definitely return your money.

11:51.489 --> 11:52.539
Okay.

11:52.559 --> 11:53.919
Goodbye.

11:56.909 --> 11:59.019
Si, you're letting the tiger
return to the mountain.

11:59.039 --> 12:00.259
Stop talking.

12:00.279 --> 12:02.649
My money...

12:02.729 --> 12:04.539
By the way, my name is Lu Chuchu.

12:04.559 --> 12:05.709
What's your name?

12:05.729 --> 12:06.869
I'm Jiang Si.

12:06.889 --> 12:08.349
Alright, I'll remember you.

12:08.369 --> 12:10.309
Miss Jiang, see you.

12:10.329 --> 12:11.889
Take care, Miss.

12:17.759 --> 12:19.119
On, no.

12:19.249 --> 12:20.259
The money is gone.

12:20.279 --> 12:21.189
Zhan.

12:21.209 --> 12:23.679
Enemies are best resolved.

12:42.639 --> 12:44.209
Miss, how did you know

12:44.209 --> 12:45.769
these formulas?

12:57.249 --> 12:59.369
This combination is right.

13:00.559 --> 13:01.739
That one too.

13:01.759 --> 13:03.139
Junior, smell this.

13:03.159 --> 13:04.769
It smells so good.

13:09.089 --> 13:11.009
Look. Is this right?

13:16.609 --> 13:18.009
I learned

13:18.089 --> 13:19.889
the formulas from books.

13:20.369 --> 13:21.709
Miss, you're really amazing.

13:21.729 --> 13:22.369
Unlike you,

13:22.379 --> 13:23.879
I can't even recognize a single word.

13:23.889 --> 13:25.019
I'm just a blind fool.

13:25.039 --> 13:26.399
Silly girl.

13:26.519 --> 13:27.639
If you want to learn,

13:27.639 --> 13:29.719
I'll teach you in the future.

13:50.159 --> 13:51.889
Give me the bracelet.

13:52.639 --> 13:53.459
But Miss,

13:53.479 --> 13:55.249
why are you bringing
sleeping incense pills

13:55.249 --> 13:57.439
to Marquis Changxing's Mansion?

14:00.129 --> 14:01.559
I'm sensitive to beds.

14:01.679 --> 14:03.469
When I go to unfamiliar places,

14:03.489 --> 14:04.969
I have nightmares.

14:16.519 --> 14:18.079
Miss Chi.

14:18.559 --> 14:19.919
Niuniu.

14:20.519 --> 14:21.879
Niuniu.

14:24.329 --> 14:26.769
None of you are getting away.

14:32.229 --> 14:34.549
You still want to run?

14:36.489 --> 14:37.589
Come here.

14:37.609 --> 14:38.969
Come here.

14:51.759 --> 14:53.399
Miss Chi.

14:53.519 --> 14:55.199
It's your turn.

14:56.249 --> 14:58.039
Your turn.

14:58.799 --> 14:59.989
Come.

15:00.009 --> 15:01.489
Come on.

15:01.729 --> 15:03.089
Come.

15:03.369 --> 15:04.379
Come.

15:04.399 --> 15:06.159
Come on.

15:06.159 --> 15:07.109
Come.

15:07.129 --> 15:08.069
Run?

15:08.089 --> 15:09.609
You want to run?

15:10.559 --> 15:11.809
Keep running.

15:11.829 --> 15:13.629
(Modest Gentleman)
Run.

15:13.639 --> 15:14.659
Run.

15:14.679 --> 15:16.069
You want to run?

15:16.089 --> 15:17.259
Run then.

15:17.279 --> 15:18.919
Keep running.

15:19.229 --> 15:26.949
(Marquis Changxing's Mansion)

15:36.389 --> 15:38.909
(Talents Galore on Blessed Land)

15:41.389 --> 15:46.709
(Marquis Changxing's Mansion)

15:52.329 --> 15:53.689
Qian.

15:54.129 --> 15:55.369
Pei.

15:55.389 --> 15:57.709
(Jiang Qiao, Jiang Si's third sister)

15:58.439 --> 15:59.799
Qiao.

16:11.369 --> 16:13.109
You finally arrived.

16:13.129 --> 16:14.769
Sorry for the wait.

16:18.729 --> 16:20.469
Sorry for the trouble.

16:20.489 --> 16:21.659
It's okay.

16:21.679 --> 16:23.019
I'm so glad

16:23.039 --> 16:25.129
you could come.

16:25.969 --> 16:27.289
You must be tired

16:27.289 --> 16:28.499
from the journey.

16:28.519 --> 16:31.279
I've prepared tea, snacks, and meals
in the flower hall.

16:31.609 --> 16:32.969
Let's go.

16:36.069 --> 16:39.589
(Capital Security Office, Court)

17:06.679 --> 17:07.289
Chief,

17:07.309 --> 17:08.719
I went to check that Tianxiang House

17:08.719 --> 17:09.659
Jiang Zhan mentioned.

17:09.679 --> 17:11.729
I haven't found anything suspicious.

17:18.089 --> 17:19.659
There are too few clues

17:19.679 --> 17:21.349
to uncover anything.

17:21.369 --> 17:22.289
I came to Ling'an

17:22.289 --> 17:23.199
to investigate

17:23.199 --> 17:24.839
the Nanwu incident,

17:24.889 --> 17:27.009
which will take some time.

17:27.239 --> 17:28.729
It won't be easy.

17:29.129 --> 17:30.529
Now...

17:33.239 --> 17:34.969
Now what?

17:37.399 --> 17:40.119
Now, we should focus on our job.

17:41.289 --> 17:43.749
The priority of Capital Security

17:43.769 --> 17:46.279
is to find Ms. Xiu's daughter.

17:46.609 --> 17:47.499
Yes.

17:47.519 --> 17:48.959
I'll get the case file.

17:56.329 --> 17:58.039
Please come this way.

17:59.809 --> 18:00.939
Qian,

18:00.959 --> 18:02.129
this garden is really big.

18:02.129 --> 18:03.969
The peonies are so beautiful.

18:04.089 --> 18:05.379
After we finish the meal,

18:05.399 --> 18:06.129
I'll take you

18:06.129 --> 18:07.869
for a walk around the garden.

18:09.159 --> 18:12.249
Si, sit here.

18:12.719 --> 18:14.449
Qiao, sit down.

18:16.049 --> 18:18.379
Make yourself comfortable here.

18:18.399 --> 18:20.009
Just treat it like home.

18:20.399 --> 18:22.409
Qian, should we

18:22.409 --> 18:24.139
go greet the Marchioness first?

18:24.159 --> 18:24.999
I've mentioned

18:25.019 --> 18:27.169
that you were coming for a short stay.

18:27.199 --> 18:28.159
The Marchioness said

18:28.159 --> 18:29.619
since you just arrived today,

18:29.639 --> 18:30.829
you should rest first

18:30.849 --> 18:33.319
and greet her tomorrow morning.

18:34.049 --> 18:34.999
(Qiao is like)

18:34.999 --> 18:36.359
(the old me, )

18:36.609 --> 18:38.109
(cautious and careful, )

18:38.129 --> 18:40.069
(always afraid of making mistakes.)

18:40.479 --> 18:41.809
You must be hungry.

18:41.809 --> 18:43.169
Let's have some food.

18:57.369 --> 18:59.799
Darling, I'm back.

19:02.239 --> 19:03.169
- Xingyu.
- Honey.

19:03.169 --> 19:04.529
Xingyu.

19:10.919 --> 19:12.559
Your sisters are here.

19:13.199 --> 19:14.559
Good.

19:18.849 --> 19:20.279
Qian.

19:20.399 --> 19:21.569
Let go of me.

19:21.569 --> 19:22.729
You smell so good.

19:22.749 --> 19:24.549
- Let go of me.
- Still want to run?

19:24.569 --> 19:26.249
Let go of me.

19:31.889 --> 19:33.639
I forgot to send someone to tell you

19:33.639 --> 19:35.279
that my sisters have arrived.

19:42.999 --> 19:44.129
I didn't know

19:44.129 --> 19:45.509
you were coming at this time.

19:45.529 --> 19:46.929
I was too abrupt.

19:47.719 --> 19:48.939
Take good care of them.

19:48.959 --> 19:50.449
I'll go to the study.

19:52.609 --> 19:54.039
Take care, honey.

19:58.679 --> 20:00.119
Qiao, Si, please sit.

20:00.159 --> 20:01.379
Qian.

20:01.399 --> 20:02.239
Does Xingyu

20:02.239 --> 20:03.979
dine with you every day?

20:03.999 --> 20:05.069
Yes.

20:05.089 --> 20:06.419
You are so affectionate.

20:06.439 --> 20:08.449
Don't tease me.

20:08.679 --> 20:10.379
These are the cases

20:10.379 --> 20:12.899
of all the missing women
in the past five years.

20:14.239 --> 20:15.309
So many.

20:15.329 --> 20:16.219
All cold cases?

20:16.239 --> 20:17.599
Yes.

20:22.399 --> 20:23.849
Chen Yushuang.

20:23.849 --> 20:26.109
(The Map of Ling'an)
Niuxing Street.

20:29.679 --> 20:32.839
Yan Xianrou, Southern Right Wing.

20:50.229 --> 20:53.749
(The Map of Ling'an)

20:58.569 --> 21:00.079
What's wrong, Chief?

21:00.289 --> 21:02.079
Is there a problem?

21:02.289 --> 21:03.829
These marks are the places

21:03.849 --> 21:04.809
where the missing women

21:04.809 --> 21:06.689
were last seen.

21:07.239 --> 21:09.369
These are the places

21:09.369 --> 21:12.009
where the missing women
have been seen in the past year.

21:12.029 --> 21:13.529
Did you notice anything?

21:13.819 --> 21:15.569
No matter
if it's from the past five years

21:15.569 --> 21:17.119
or the past year,

21:18.439 --> 21:19.459
nothing has happened

21:19.479 --> 21:21.689
(White Tiger Bridge)
in this area.

21:22.039 --> 21:23.439
This stone from the artificial hill

21:23.439 --> 21:25.249
was brought from South Lake.

21:25.369 --> 21:27.219
This is called the Bayin Pavilion.

21:27.239 --> 21:28.419
Qian,

21:28.439 --> 21:30.969
those peonies look so beautiful.

21:32.919 --> 21:34.659
You came at just the right time.

21:34.679 --> 21:36.659
If you had come a little later,

21:36.679 --> 21:38.359
the peonies would've withered.

21:38.639 --> 21:39.609
Shall we go

21:39.609 --> 21:40.969
enjoy the flowers?

21:41.639 --> 21:42.809
I'm not used

21:42.809 --> 21:44.269
to the scent of peonies.

21:44.289 --> 21:45.139
How about this?

21:45.159 --> 21:46.749
I'll rest in the pavilion.

21:46.769 --> 21:47.829
You can do as you please.

21:47.849 --> 21:49.729
I'll accompany you to the pavilion.

21:49.799 --> 21:50.669
Alright.

21:50.679 --> 21:53.209
Si, let's go together.

21:53.479 --> 21:54.839
Alright.

22:02.959 --> 22:04.029
Chief,

22:04.049 --> 22:04.959
those two people

22:04.959 --> 22:05.799
were just bought off.

22:05.799 --> 22:07.939
Would it be useful for us
to find them now?

22:07.959 --> 22:09.929
We're already here. No more talking.

22:11.109 --> 22:14.109
(Wonton)

22:17.049 --> 22:18.409
Come here.

22:19.959 --> 22:21.719
My Lord, we know we are wrong.

22:21.719 --> 22:23.529
We won't dare again, My Lord.

22:23.809 --> 22:25.449
Yes, yes.

22:25.529 --> 22:27.269
We were confused

22:27.289 --> 22:28.749
and blinded by money.

22:28.769 --> 22:30.239
We only did this one wrong thing.

22:30.239 --> 22:31.769
I'm not asking about that.

22:32.809 --> 22:35.009
Have you seen the woman
in the painting?

22:35.529 --> 22:36.889
Who is this?

22:39.439 --> 22:41.249
This woman in the picture

22:41.769 --> 22:43.729
went missing earlier this year.

22:49.439 --> 22:51.409
Where are you going?

22:52.399 --> 22:53.939
I'm standing here.

22:53.959 --> 22:55.219
Where are you going?

22:55.239 --> 22:56.599
Jump down, then.

22:57.719 --> 22:59.119
My Lord,

22:59.529 --> 23:01.639
please spare us.

23:02.769 --> 23:04.309
We don't dare to discuss matters

23:04.329 --> 23:05.609
about major officials.

23:05.609 --> 23:06.459
What major officials?

23:06.479 --> 23:08.679
She's not the only woman missing.

23:08.679 --> 23:10.209
This is a major case.

23:15.639 --> 23:16.999
It's

23:17.049 --> 23:19.359
Marquis Changxing's heir.

23:20.239 --> 23:22.179
This is the woman who came

23:22.199 --> 23:24.039
with Marquis Changxing's heir.

23:24.959 --> 23:26.869
That day, the heir

23:26.889 --> 23:28.049
brought this woman

23:28.049 --> 23:29.929
to my stall

23:29.929 --> 23:31.269
for some wonton.

23:31.289 --> 23:32.329
A customer finished eating,

23:32.329 --> 23:33.309
stood up to leave,

23:33.329 --> 23:35.029
and accidentally hit the heir.

23:35.049 --> 23:37.009
That customer apologized,

23:37.289 --> 23:39.559
but the heir wouldn't let it go.

23:39.719 --> 23:41.079
He was so scary.

23:41.399 --> 23:42.239
Yes, yes.

23:42.249 --> 23:44.309
A lot of people saw it.

23:44.329 --> 23:45.879
That woman even tried

23:45.959 --> 23:47.879
to talk to the heir.

23:48.569 --> 23:49.439
At this time,

23:49.439 --> 23:51.929
the peonies are
at the end of the season.

23:52.049 --> 23:54.089
The peonies elsewhere

23:54.089 --> 23:55.039
often look

23:55.039 --> 23:56.309
a little wilted,

23:56.329 --> 23:57.479
but look at these here.

23:57.479 --> 23:59.009
They are so beautiful.

23:59.329 --> 24:00.509
This one looks nice.

24:00.529 --> 24:02.039
That one too.

24:02.889 --> 24:04.509
The flowers here bloom like a sunset.

24:04.529 --> 24:06.639
It's truly a rare sight.

24:12.679 --> 24:15.009
Si, what's wrong?

24:15.399 --> 24:16.499
Nothing.

24:16.519 --> 24:19.099
(Why is there a foul smell
among the floral scent?)

24:19.159 --> 24:20.419
(I recognize this smell.)

24:20.439 --> 24:21.939
(It's the smell of a corpse.)

24:21.959 --> 24:24.039
(Under these peonies...)

24:36.129 --> 24:37.049
It's really beautiful.

24:37.049 --> 24:38.799
Qiao, don't touch it.

24:40.719 --> 24:44.039
Si, why can't I touch it?

24:44.239 --> 24:45.599
These flowers...

24:45.679 --> 24:47.279
I can smell a bad odor.

24:47.569 --> 24:49.209
Can't you smell it?

24:52.049 --> 24:55.039
Now that you mention it,
it does seem like it.

25:08.239 --> 25:09.879
It's not gold or silver.

25:10.159 --> 25:12.309
What material is this?

25:12.329 --> 25:13.769
It's a copper hairpin.

25:13.809 --> 25:15.069
A copper hairpin?

25:15.089 --> 25:16.899
I noticed

25:16.899 --> 25:17.849
that even the maids here

25:17.849 --> 25:19.509
wear gold or silver hairpins.

25:19.529 --> 25:20.479
Why is there

25:20.479 --> 25:21.589
a copper hairpin here?

25:21.609 --> 25:22.999
(If a corpse is buried)

25:22.999 --> 25:24.509
(under these peonies, )

25:24.529 --> 25:25.699
(could this copper hairpin)

25:25.719 --> 25:27.139
(belong to the victim?)

25:27.159 --> 25:29.689
What are you two doing?

25:33.199 --> 25:34.559
Young Master Cao.

25:37.239 --> 25:38.349
Hello, Xingyu.

25:38.369 --> 25:40.279
I'm admiring the flowers with Si.

25:41.289 --> 25:43.639
(Can someone really be so cruel?)

25:43.749 --> 25:44.999
(I need to find another chance)

25:44.999 --> 25:46.689
(to investigate again.)

25:47.959 --> 25:49.829
The peonies here

25:49.849 --> 25:52.879
do bloom better than anywhere else.

25:53.289 --> 25:55.929
Please, take your time.

26:05.199 --> 26:07.459
Pei, have some perilla drink.

26:07.479 --> 26:08.839
Qian,

26:08.919 --> 26:11.559
Si really looks beautiful.

26:11.679 --> 26:13.199
Standing among the peonies,

26:13.199 --> 26:15.449
she's more beautiful than the flowers.

26:15.469 --> 26:16.479
Even Xingyu couldn't help

26:16.479 --> 26:17.839
but look at her.

26:20.569 --> 26:21.929
It's so delicious.

26:24.999 --> 26:27.079
Did I say something wrong?

26:28.719 --> 26:30.209
No.

26:30.569 --> 26:32.559
Among us,

26:32.609 --> 26:33.869
even in all of Ling'an,

26:33.889 --> 26:35.479
there's hardly anyone

26:35.479 --> 26:37.079
who can surpass Si in looks.

26:37.919 --> 26:40.359
I feel honored to have a sister

26:40.399 --> 26:42.279
who is as beautiful as Luoshen.

26:42.529 --> 26:44.059
Even if she's as pretty as a goddess,

26:44.059 --> 26:45.089
she can't compare to you.

26:45.089 --> 26:46.269
You married well.

26:46.289 --> 26:47.739
Xingyu is cultured and elegant,

26:47.759 --> 26:49.129
and he's Marquis Changxing's heir

26:49.129 --> 26:50.319
of noble status.

26:50.809 --> 26:52.689
Now, look at Si.

26:53.849 --> 26:55.139
She canceled her engagement.

26:55.159 --> 26:57.139
She'll most likely never get married.

26:57.609 --> 26:58.459
Qian,

26:58.479 --> 27:00.069
we're sisters.

27:00.089 --> 27:01.659
I can't help but remind you

27:01.679 --> 27:04.069
to be wary of Si.

27:04.089 --> 27:05.089
Don't let her stay

27:05.089 --> 27:06.449
with Xingyu.

27:06.569 --> 27:08.609
(Once Cao Xingyu targets a woman, )

27:08.609 --> 27:10.839
(he won't stop until he has her.)

27:11.089 --> 27:12.129
(It's Jiang Si's fault)

27:12.129 --> 27:13.549
(for being too attractive)

27:13.569 --> 27:14.649
(and losing the engagement)

27:14.649 --> 27:16.929
(with Duke An's son.)

27:17.089 --> 27:18.879
(I don't need to feel guilty.)

27:18.919 --> 27:20.359
Miss Si.

27:30.529 --> 27:31.889
Qian.

27:32.719 --> 27:34.659
Why aren't you two
playing a little longer?

27:34.679 --> 27:37.139
The peonies are indeed beautiful,

27:37.159 --> 27:39.149
but the fragrance is too strong.

27:39.169 --> 27:40.939
It's unbearable
if you stay for too long.

27:40.959 --> 27:42.109
However beautiful a scene is,

27:42.109 --> 27:44.189
it loses its charm
if you look at it for too long.

27:44.189 --> 27:46.559
Sit and rest then.

27:49.049 --> 27:50.239
Bring over the freshly-made

27:50.239 --> 27:51.829
perilla drink for them.

27:51.849 --> 27:53.549
Are you tired?

27:53.569 --> 27:55.769
I'll have a maid take you to rest.

27:55.809 --> 27:57.409
I'll listen to you.

27:57.799 --> 27:59.719
The West and East Chambers
where the heir stays

27:59.719 --> 28:01.179
have always been empty.

28:01.239 --> 28:02.979
Qiao, Pei,

28:02.999 --> 28:05.219
you two can stay in the West Chamber.

28:05.239 --> 28:07.079
Si can stay in the East Chamber.

28:07.159 --> 28:08.699
What do you think?

28:08.719 --> 28:11.269
(It's easier for him if I live alone.)

28:11.289 --> 28:12.129
(That's good.)

28:12.139 --> 28:13.279
(Then Qiao won't be dragged)

28:13.279 --> 28:14.199
(into this.)

28:14.199 --> 28:15.239
Why should Si get to stay

28:15.249 --> 28:16.619
in a separate chamber?

28:16.639 --> 28:17.999
Pei.

28:19.439 --> 28:20.749
Qian,

28:20.769 --> 28:21.619
I don't want to stay

28:21.619 --> 28:22.779
in the same chamber as Qiao.

28:22.779 --> 28:23.849
She's so quiet.

28:23.849 --> 28:25.709
It'll be boring to live with her.

28:27.439 --> 28:30.179
Then I'll stay in the West Chamber
with Si.

28:30.199 --> 28:31.749
Pei can stay in the East Chamber.

28:31.769 --> 28:33.129
Alright.

28:34.479 --> 28:35.969
Pei is worried that her teeth grinding

28:35.969 --> 28:38.029
at night will scare you.

28:38.049 --> 28:39.879
Qiao, are you scared?

28:40.529 --> 28:41.679
If it's not a problem,

28:41.679 --> 28:43.209
then it's settled.

28:43.399 --> 28:45.789
Si, we haven't met in a long time.

28:45.809 --> 28:46.959
I'll visit you tonight

28:46.959 --> 28:48.139
to chat with you.

28:48.159 --> 28:49.979
(Are you that eager?)

28:49.999 --> 28:51.619
(I fell into this trap before.)

28:51.639 --> 28:53.409
(How could I fall for it again?)

28:53.609 --> 28:56.119
I saw you not long ago.

28:56.329 --> 28:57.889
If I talk with you again,

28:57.889 --> 28:58.959
Pei might get jealous,

28:58.959 --> 29:00.039
saying I've been

29:00.039 --> 29:00.929
monopolizing you.

29:00.949 --> 29:01.889
Pei, on the other hand,

29:01.889 --> 29:03.619
hasn't seen you in a long time.

29:03.639 --> 29:05.159
I'm sure she has

29:05.159 --> 29:06.419
a lot to say to you.

29:06.439 --> 29:07.929
Yes, yes, Qian.

29:09.479 --> 29:10.319
Alright.

29:10.319 --> 29:11.869
I'll accompany Pei tonight

29:11.889 --> 29:13.869
and go find you tomorrow.

29:13.889 --> 29:15.789
(It's hard to bring him down, )

29:15.809 --> 29:17.309
(but however difficult, )

29:17.369 --> 29:19.599
(I'll make sure he pays the price.)

29:20.719 --> 29:23.179
Si has endured such humiliation.

29:23.199 --> 29:25.749
How can we keep quiet?

29:25.769 --> 29:27.979
Even if I risk my life,

29:27.999 --> 29:28.959
I will never

29:28.959 --> 29:30.749
let Cao Xingyu have it easy.

29:30.769 --> 29:32.109
Let's go, Si.

29:32.129 --> 29:33.659
Let's report to the authorities.

29:33.679 --> 29:35.239
Brother, you can't go.

29:35.239 --> 29:37.769
No one steps out of this door.

29:38.369 --> 29:40.969
Grandmother, what do you mean?

29:42.159 --> 29:44.549
Brother, stop causing a scene.

29:44.569 --> 29:45.889
If this continues,

29:45.889 --> 29:48.209
Si's reputation will be ruined.

29:48.229 --> 29:49.639
How will she ever hold her head high

29:49.639 --> 29:52.279
at Duke An's Mansion?

29:54.609 --> 29:57.129
You're just trying to save
your daughter's face.

29:57.129 --> 29:58.699
Is your daughter's face

29:58.719 --> 30:01.799
more important than Si's innocence?

30:02.719 --> 30:04.719
Si is my niece.

30:04.719 --> 30:06.879
I'm worried about her too.

30:06.919 --> 30:08.869
Si has been wronged.

30:08.889 --> 30:11.219
We're definitely concerned.

30:11.239 --> 30:13.549
But given the Marquis's status,

30:13.569 --> 30:14.959
even if you report it,

30:14.959 --> 30:16.459
what will it do?

30:16.479 --> 30:18.199
It's like hitting a stone with an egg.

30:18.199 --> 30:19.039
Uncle Anmou,

30:19.049 --> 30:20.699
you're worried
that offending the Marquis

30:20.719 --> 30:22.379
would ruin your promotion, right?

30:22.399 --> 30:23.699
That's too harsh.

30:23.719 --> 30:24.659
Let's go.

30:24.679 --> 30:26.589
If you step out of this door today,

30:26.609 --> 30:28.199
Ancheng, you can come back

30:28.199 --> 30:29.929
and collect my corpse.

30:30.159 --> 30:32.439
My Lady, don't do that.

30:32.439 --> 30:33.799
My Lady.

30:34.439 --> 30:36.489
My Lady, don't do that.

30:37.479 --> 30:40.209
Mother, don't.

30:43.369 --> 30:44.729
Father.

30:46.369 --> 30:47.729
Father.

30:54.029 --> 30:56.749
(Haitang Chamber)
Si.

30:56.769 --> 30:58.689
Sorry for my incapability.

30:59.809 --> 31:00.849
I've asked many girls

31:00.849 --> 31:02.659
who've been wronged by him,

31:02.679 --> 31:04.169
but no one is willing

31:04.169 --> 31:05.929
to come forward as a witness.

31:06.329 --> 31:07.889
Many of the girls

31:07.889 --> 31:08.849
have gone missing.

31:08.849 --> 31:11.969
I think he's behind it.

31:12.199 --> 31:13.829
Many girls

31:13.849 --> 31:14.939
have gone missing?

31:14.959 --> 31:16.929
It's only a suspicion.

31:17.399 --> 31:19.269
Without evidence,

31:19.289 --> 31:21.489
how can we report it?

31:23.849 --> 31:25.209
Father,

31:25.719 --> 31:27.079
forget it.

31:27.609 --> 31:29.449
Let's not pursue it any further.

31:29.569 --> 31:31.029
Aunt Xiao is right.

31:31.049 --> 31:32.879
That jerk didn't succeed.

31:33.049 --> 31:34.829
If this escalates,

31:34.849 --> 31:35.959
it will be difficult for me

31:35.959 --> 31:37.529
to lift my head in front

31:37.569 --> 31:39.489
of my mother-in-law and husband.

32:24.919 --> 32:27.279
Miss, Miss Qiao has come.

32:28.239 --> 32:29.599
Si.

32:31.329 --> 32:32.929
Qiao.

32:33.329 --> 32:35.209
Why haven't you rested yet?

32:35.569 --> 32:36.699
Si.

32:36.719 --> 32:38.799
Can I sleep with you?

32:39.719 --> 32:41.839
I'm used to sleeping alone.

32:41.919 --> 32:43.089
I'm a bit uncomfortable

32:43.089 --> 32:44.619
with the change of place.

32:44.639 --> 32:45.569
I need someone familiar

32:45.569 --> 32:46.979
to sleep soundly.

32:46.999 --> 32:48.929
Just sleep with me tonight.

32:49.399 --> 32:51.289
I'm used to sleeping alone.

32:51.289 --> 32:52.659
I really can't sleep.

32:52.679 --> 32:54.159
Just stay with me for one night.

32:54.159 --> 32:55.519
Okay?

32:55.849 --> 32:58.009
Nuo, make the bed.

33:04.889 --> 33:06.219
How about this?

33:06.239 --> 33:07.689
You sleep inside.

33:08.239 --> 33:11.039
Si, I'm used to sleeping on the outside.

33:11.129 --> 33:12.569
I didn't expect you to have

33:12.569 --> 33:14.639
so many requirements for sleeping.

33:15.129 --> 33:16.979
Tonight, just let me

33:16.999 --> 33:18.659
sleep on the outside.

33:18.679 --> 33:20.569
- You should...
- It's late.

33:20.569 --> 33:22.079
Let's sleep.

33:22.329 --> 33:24.309
(Last time, Qiao didn't come.)

33:24.329 --> 33:25.969
(Why is she here this time?)

33:26.239 --> 33:27.139
(And)

33:27.159 --> 33:29.269
(Qiao isn't usually so insistent.)

33:29.289 --> 33:30.799
(What's going on today?)

33:32.129 --> 33:34.409
(Qian and her husband are targeting me.)

33:34.639 --> 33:36.699
(If Jiang Qiao is always with me, )

33:36.719 --> 33:38.879
(it'll be dangerous for her.)

33:39.399 --> 33:41.559
(Since they can hurt me, )

33:41.639 --> 33:42.829
(they absolutely won't)

33:42.849 --> 33:44.529
(show mercy to Jiang Qiao.)

33:45.569 --> 33:46.699
(Only tonight.)

33:46.719 --> 33:49.079
(I can't let her cling to me tomorrow.)

33:49.609 --> 33:51.449
(As for tonight...)

35:07.919 --> 35:09.669
Nuo, light the lamp.

35:09.689 --> 35:11.559
Nuo, Aman, light the lamp.

35:11.769 --> 35:13.409
Hurry and light the lamp.

35:26.209 --> 35:28.939
Alright, you can leave now.

35:28.959 --> 35:30.489
Stay outside.

35:30.849 --> 35:32.209
Yes.

35:38.649 --> 35:40.009
Si.

35:40.889 --> 35:42.559
Did you see him?

35:42.849 --> 35:44.929
Cao Xingyu is a beast.

35:49.479 --> 35:50.839
Qiao,

35:52.119 --> 35:54.229
you already suspected.

35:54.249 --> 35:56.189
Si, we'll return tomorrow.

35:56.209 --> 35:57.079
Qian will definitely

35:57.079 --> 35:58.099
try to stop us.

35:58.119 --> 35:59.519
Is she going to physically stop us

35:59.519 --> 36:00.969
from leaving?

36:13.729 --> 36:15.119
Si.

36:17.079 --> 36:18.439
Qian...

36:21.369 --> 36:23.159
Si, let's go back tomorrow.

36:23.159 --> 36:24.479
- Okay?
- No.

36:24.479 --> 36:26.419
Right now, in their eyes,

36:26.439 --> 36:27.939
you're an outsider.

36:27.959 --> 36:29.079
If you demand

36:29.079 --> 36:30.459
to leave tomorrow morning...

36:30.479 --> 36:32.679
As you sleep with me tonight,

36:32.919 --> 36:34.309
and that beast comes by,

36:34.329 --> 36:35.289
they'll surely think

36:35.289 --> 36:37.159
you've discovered something.

36:37.889 --> 36:40.579
Qiao, give me some time.

36:40.599 --> 36:41.979
I'll go check it out.

36:41.999 --> 36:42.849
I'll go with you.

36:42.849 --> 36:44.209
It's fine.

37:08.849 --> 37:10.209
The heir went out last night,

37:10.209 --> 37:11.829
and he looked off when he came back.

37:11.849 --> 37:12.689
He may be upset

37:12.689 --> 37:14.379
so he came for her.

37:14.399 --> 37:16.039
She's unlucky

37:16.039 --> 37:17.679
and is meant to die today.

37:31.479 --> 37:33.489
Anzi, help me. Hurry.

37:40.559 --> 37:42.019
I'll go get the spade.

37:43.619 --> 37:44.839
It has nothing to do with me.

37:44.859 --> 37:45.939
Don't come looking for me.

37:45.959 --> 37:48.119
It was the heir who killed you.

37:49.369 --> 37:50.929
You'll be buried soon.

37:51.399 --> 37:53.309
One of the spades is missing.

37:53.329 --> 37:55.119
Did someone take it?

37:55.119 --> 37:56.499
How could that happen?

37:56.519 --> 37:58.269
The gardener tidied up for us earlier.

37:58.289 --> 37:59.479
After we scolded them,

37:59.479 --> 38:01.059
no one dared to touch it again.

38:01.079 --> 38:02.929
Get a hoe. Hurry.

38:12.399 --> 38:13.239
What's wrong?

38:13.249 --> 38:16.719
Her hand...

38:18.479 --> 38:21.079
There's a ghost.

39:12.099 --> 39:12.999
Don't blame me.

39:12.999 --> 39:14.559
You shouldn't have seen this.

39:14.559 --> 39:15.559
Do we have to kill her?

39:15.569 --> 39:16.769
Should we give her to the heir?

39:16.769 --> 39:18.189
If she doesn't die, we will.

39:18.209 --> 39:19.229
Hurry up and help.

39:19.249 --> 39:20.609
Hurry.

39:21.209 --> 39:22.349
(I can't die.)

39:22.369 --> 39:24.009
(I can't die.)

39:46.039 --> 39:47.449
Yu Qi?

39:49.369 --> 39:51.009
Yu what? Hurry and run.

40:00.809 --> 40:02.489
Why are you here?

40:04.039 --> 40:05.209
Looks like Commandant Yu

40:05.209 --> 40:07.159
isn't good at investigating.

40:07.209 --> 40:08.439
You didn't even know

40:08.439 --> 40:09.979
Marquis Changxing's heir

40:09.999 --> 40:11.149
is my son-in-law.

40:11.169 --> 40:12.869
You're still making jokes.

40:12.889 --> 40:14.599
If I hadn't arrived in time,

40:14.599 --> 40:16.809
you wouldn't have had
the chance to joke.

40:16.959 --> 40:18.799
Then why are you here?

40:18.819 --> 40:20.499
I'm investigating the missing cases.

40:20.519 --> 40:22.409
I think it's related to Cao Xingyu.

40:23.119 --> 40:25.759
Did he do anything to you?

40:27.249 --> 40:29.079
What should he have done to me?

40:30.729 --> 40:32.089
That's good.

40:32.399 --> 40:35.009
Why do they want to kill you?

40:39.079 --> 40:40.969
If you want to live, don't move.

40:41.039 --> 40:41.899
Listen carefully.

40:41.919 --> 40:43.849
Tonight, after you finish your work,

40:43.849 --> 40:45.899
you lie down here and sleep.

40:45.919 --> 40:48.009
You haven't met anyone.

40:49.119 --> 40:50.479
Got it?

40:55.599 --> 40:57.409
You haven't got it then.

41:01.209 --> 41:03.969
Look, this is what I found
in the flower bushes.

41:04.119 --> 41:05.579
I saw them

41:05.599 --> 41:06.939
killing and burying the body.

41:06.959 --> 41:08.059
I suspect

41:08.079 --> 41:09.869
there may be more victims.

41:09.889 --> 41:11.849
They are so bold.

41:12.479 --> 41:14.789
Businesswomen often wear
copper hairpins.

41:14.809 --> 41:16.849
Tomorrow, I will go verify.

41:17.119 --> 41:18.079
If Ms. Xiu's daughter

41:18.079 --> 41:19.379
really has died,

41:19.399 --> 41:20.729
- what should she do?
- Enough.

41:20.729 --> 41:22.709
Stop worrying about others.

41:22.709 --> 41:24.079
Worry about yourself for a moment.

41:24.079 --> 41:26.059
It's too dangerous here. Come with me.

41:26.079 --> 41:27.439
Yu Qi,

41:28.039 --> 41:29.399
I can't leave.

41:29.439 --> 41:30.929
Tell me why.

41:30.929 --> 41:32.059
Why can't you leave?

41:32.079 --> 41:33.229
If I leave now,

41:33.249 --> 41:34.439
Cao Xingyu will think of ways

41:34.439 --> 41:35.899
to deal with my family.

41:35.919 --> 41:37.539
My second sister is his wife.

41:37.559 --> 41:38.919
Although...

41:40.039 --> 41:41.719
Although it was her

41:41.769 --> 41:43.209
who brought me here...

41:43.229 --> 41:44.439
There's also my third sister.

41:44.439 --> 41:45.439
She's so weak,

41:45.439 --> 41:47.129
yet she's still trying to protect me.

41:47.149 --> 41:48.039
And my fifth sister...

41:48.039 --> 41:49.409
- Wait.
- She...

41:50.999 --> 41:52.929
What do you mean?

41:52.929 --> 41:54.919
Your second sister brought you here?

41:59.169 --> 42:00.649
No, it's too dangerous here.

42:00.649 --> 42:02.149
I'll take you home now.

42:02.169 --> 42:04.749
After we get back,
I'll report to the Capital Security.

42:04.769 --> 42:05.979
Yu Qi,

42:05.999 --> 42:07.489
calm down.

42:07.519 --> 42:09.349
Marquis Changxing has imperial favor,

42:09.369 --> 42:11.099
and Cao Xingyu is his only son.

42:11.119 --> 42:12.459
I know very well

42:12.479 --> 42:13.869
that acting impulsively

42:13.889 --> 42:15.079
will only alert the enemy.

42:15.079 --> 42:16.149
Jiang Si,

42:16.169 --> 42:17.769
I've found the witness.

42:17.769 --> 42:19.329
That's the crime scene.

42:19.329 --> 42:21.169
If I bring people over to search,

42:21.169 --> 42:22.289
we'll surely find evidence.

42:22.289 --> 42:23.459
It's useless.

42:23.479 --> 42:24.999
Without thorough preparation,

42:24.999 --> 42:26.759
the evidence will vanish,

42:26.759 --> 42:28.899
and the witnesses will disappear
into thin air.

42:28.919 --> 42:30.559
What do you mean?

42:31.039 --> 42:32.039
Have you already

42:32.039 --> 42:33.379
done something?

42:33.399 --> 42:34.559
Anyway, you must trust me.

42:34.559 --> 42:35.749
I really can't leave.

42:35.769 --> 42:36.809
If I leave now,

42:36.809 --> 42:38.079
it will only alert them,

42:38.079 --> 42:39.799
and your case
will be delayed indefinitely.

42:39.809 --> 42:41.339
Who will answer for those

42:41.339 --> 42:42.939
who've lost their daughters and sisters?

42:42.959 --> 42:44.029
Marquis Changxing's Mansion

42:44.029 --> 42:45.539
is no ordinary place.

42:45.559 --> 42:47.979
This needs careful planning.

42:47.999 --> 42:49.199
We can't rush into anything.

42:49.209 --> 42:53.509
(The End of Episode 4)

42:53.959 --> 42:55.689
♪ From place to place ♪

42:55.689 --> 43:00.629
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

43:00.999 --> 43:03.379
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

43:03.379 --> 43:07.609
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

43:08.319 --> 43:10.719
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

43:10.739 --> 43:14.399
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

43:14.419 --> 43:17.839
♪ Growing between us ♪

43:17.989 --> 43:23.509
♪ And breeding love ♪

43:24.329 --> 43:28.009
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

43:28.009 --> 43:32.089
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

43:32.329 --> 43:34.069
♪ Like shadows ♪

43:34.089 --> 43:38.789
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

43:38.789 --> 43:42.359
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

43:42.379 --> 43:46.609
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

43:46.629 --> 43:48.409
♪ Time glows ♪

43:48.409 --> 43:52.949
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

43:52.969 --> 43:57.769
♪ And stars ♪

44:01.999 --> 44:04.529
♪ Don't ask what our fate is ♪

44:04.549 --> 44:08.169
♪ Let life carve the growth rings ♪

44:08.189 --> 44:11.619
♪ We'll reach the end eventually ♪

44:11.639 --> 44:16.259
♪ All will bloom in spring ♪

44:16.259 --> 44:19.949
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

44:19.969 --> 44:24.059
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:24.169 --> 44:25.989
♪ Time glows ♪

44:25.989 --> 44:30.539
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:30.559 --> 44:34.259
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

44:34.279 --> 44:38.439
♪ We travel at night in the cold ♪

44:38.619 --> 44:40.379
♪ The moonlight shines like water ♪

44:40.379 --> 44:44.899
♪ Those in love will have sweet dreams ♪

44:44.899 --> 44:48.539
♪ Cherish each other in the future ♪

44:48.559 --> 44:54.229
♪ Time goes by, but memories remain ♪

44:55.919 --> 44:57.849
♪ Take a look to remember everything ♪

44:57.849 --> 45:05.349
♪ We will see flowers fill the city again ♪
